-- 1 161.48..., rounded up to 1 162.
#ASSERT `the s 40 payment for` (`Mia's surgery, asked on` (`the calendar date` 15 5 2028) `approved` TRUE) `with` `the reg 26 CPI` EQUALS `the supplementary income support payment is` 1162
-- 1 August 2028 is 92 days after the surgery: more than 13 weeks.
#ASSERT `the s 40 payment for` (`Mia's surgery, asked on` (`the calendar date` 1 8 2028) `approved` TRUE) `with` `the reg 26 CPI` EQUALS `no supplementary income support: more than 13 weeks after the surgery`
#ASSERT `the s 40 payment for` (`Mia's surgery, asked on` (`the calendar date` 15 5 2028) `approved` FALSE) `with` `the reg 26 CPI` EQUALS `no supplementary income support: the surgery was not approved by the Corporation`
#ASSERT `the s 40 payment for` (`Mia's surgery, asked on` (`the calendar date` 1 2 2028) `approved` TRUE) `with` `the reg 26 CPI` EQUALS `no supplementary income support: the day is not after the second designated period`

§ `Seriously injured workers and damages (ss 21, 72)`

GIVEN `physical` IS A NUMBER, `psychiatric` IS A NUMBER, `after the designated day` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `Impairment facts`
`an assessment of` `physical` `physical and` `psychiatric` `psychiatric, examined after the designated day` `after the designated day` MEANS
    `Impairment facts` WITH
        `the whole person impairment from physical injury, in per cent`     IS `physical`
        `the whole person impairment from psychiatric injury, in per cent`  IS `psychiatric`
        `the final examination was on or after the 2022 designated day`     IS `after the designated day`

#ASSERT `the s 21 answer for` (`an assessment of` 36 `physical and` 0 `psychiatric, examined after the designated day` TRUE) `with an interim decision` FALSE EQUALS `a seriously injured worker (s 21(2))`
#ASSERT `the s 21 answer for` (`an assessment of` 34 `physical and` 0 `psychiatric, examined after the designated day` TRUE) `with an interim decision` FALSE EQUALS `not a seriously injured worker (s 21(5))`
-- s 21(8): 20% physical and 15% psychiatric are not added together.
#ASSERT `the s 21 answer for` (`an assessment of` 20 `physical and` 15 `psychiatric, examined after the designated day` TRUE) `with an interim decision` FALSE EQUALS `not a seriously injured worker (s 21(5))`
#ASSERT `the s 21 answer for` (`an assessment of` 0 `physical and` 30 `psychiatric, examined after the designated day` TRUE) `with an interim decision` FALSE EQUALS `a seriously injured worker (s 21(2))`
#ASSERT `the s 21 answer for` (`an assessment of` 36 `physical and` 0 `psychiatric, examined after the designated day` FALSE) `with an interim decision` FALSE EQUALS `not covered: the threshold for a physical injury whose final examination was before the 2022 designated day is not in the deposited text`
#ASSERT `the s 72 answer for` (`an assessment of` 35 `physical and` 0 `psychiatric, examined after the designated day` TRUE) `with death` FALSE EQUALS `damages may be awarded against the employer, if the general law gives them (s 72(1))`
#ASSERT `the s 72 answer for` (`an assessment of` 34 `physical and` 0 `psychiatric, examined after the designated day` TRUE) `with death` FALSE EQUALS `no damages may be awarded against the employer (s 72(1))`
#ASSERT `the s 72 answer for` (`an assessment of` 0 `physical and` 0 `psychiatric, examined after the designated day` TRUE) `with death` TRUE EQUALS `damages may be awarded against the employer, if the general law gives them (s 72(1))`
-- A psychiatric injury alone (20%), examined before the designated day: clause 2 does not reach it, so plainly not; a 40%
-- physical injury examined before it: not covered.
